16037884985730"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114071324981174272"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T19:07:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114071357193687181"],"id":"2114071357193687181","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":21210,"like_count":466,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":13},"text":"I tried to make a video about the updates to the Cybercab since launch. I had to keep re-editing it before upload because Telsa kept updating Cybercab. And after the video went live, there's new info!\n\nThis is the craziest pace of updates I've seen to a Tesla product yet. https://t.co/f6cS0Rz4KB","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114071357193687181"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T18:44:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114065532936704112"],"id":"2114065532936704112","in_reply_to_user_id":"1118594454515003393","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2249,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114065343098339533","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Originally I had this bot set up for holiday gift giving, but over time it's going to learn what the people I buy gifts for like. It's going to continually suggest gifts for birthdays and other holidays, along with random gifts as well, just for fun","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114065532936704112"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T18:43:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114065343098339533"],"id":"2114065343098339533","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":5301,"like_count":56,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Getting ready to get this kid's Christmas presents with the help of Grok @bot\n\nI told it what my kids like. Then it helps find hard to get gifts. Compares across all stores, but knows your preferred stores. Avoids scalpers/fake listings.\n\nTry it out: https://t.co/xC9rMv5Kh5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114065343098339533"},{"created_at":"2026-10-24T04:53:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_